.stopping_rules[1].rule="New shared allowance 21600 additive active-worker seconds from 2026-10-30T05:17:54Z and outer expiry 2026-10-30T11:17:54Z; stop at earlier cap, reviewed operational guard or expiry. One active payload; unchanged 25million coefficient cap, 8GiB and 3600 seconds per execution, each bounded by remaining allowance. Charge controls, warmups, computation, fresh epochs, independent replay, retries and recovery. Preserve every earlier budget and incurred cost separately; no refund. Existing infrastructure-only maximum two attempts and one restore retained within this allowance." |
.stopping_rules[2].rule="This draft permits exactly ONE prospectively authorized replacement of b1's incomplete operational-deadline gate, after freeze/admission. Retain b1 unchanged and do not splice its warmups into replacement coverage. Any wrong answer, geometric violation, scientific cap/exhaustion, missing replacement gate, unsupported category or failed independent replay blocks later cohort. No automatic further scientific retry, seed or method replacement." |
.amendments += [{id:"A-known-prior-b1-prospective-replacement-20261030",filed:"2026-10-30",filed_before_affected_data:true,reason:"User authorized six hours for one replacement gate plus remaining pencil cohort. Amendment is after known b1 failure but before every replacement observation it affects; it does not reclassify or backdate prior data.",changes:["Retain identical source543a54b, binary, exact p186379target0 workload/spec/seeds, three arms, 18 rows, 15 measured rows and 36 finite cells.","Permit one replacement only; preserve incomplete b1 and all prior costs.","New 21600 active-worker-second allowance and outer expiry11:17:54Z, including all new control/warmup/replay/recovery work.","No early-rejection fork integration and no timing qualification.","Remaining cohort still requires complete replacement gate, all15 independent non-wall replays and independent review plus separate prospective full-cohort admission."],supersedes_fields:["question","execution.placement.admission_status","stopping_rules","extensions.continuation_envelope","extensions.upper_gate.execution_request"]}] |
